    <briefdescription>
<para>A class to represent a value that can be either static or dynamic. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>static_v</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The static value. If the value is &apos;reserved&apos;, it means it&apos;s dynamic. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>reserved</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>A reserved value indicating the value is dynamic.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
All arithmetic and logic operators are supported (if the original type supports them). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
